&lt;li&gt;* Is the presentation of the work clear, with regards to language and grammar?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;* Does the title of this paper clearly reflect its content?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;* Does the abstract sufficiently reflect the content?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;* Are the keywords representative of the research?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;* Does the introduction present the purpose of the investigation and is the purpose supported by the pertinent literature?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;* Are the methods described sufficiently to allow the study to be repeated by other parties?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;* Are &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.rrids.org/&#34;&gt;Research Resource Identifiers &lt;/a&gt;(RRID) included where applicable?&lt;/li&gt;
